# 期：15
# 期：1
# 期：3
# 期：[hwæt, wyrd]
# 期：rǣw
引「../src/wyrd.yx」为 Wyrd；

Wyrd.运行（「\n    cræft bindan(x) dō\n        cræft eacan(y) dō\n            ġield x + y;\n        ende\n        ġield eacan;\n    ende\n\n    fæst eac_tīen = bindan(10);\n    cweþ eac_tīen(5);\n\n    lǣt n = 0;\n    þāhwīle n < 5 dō\n        n = n + 1;\n        gif n == 2 þonne\n            forþ;\n        ende\n        gif n == 4 þonne\n            breċ;\n        ende\n        cweþ n;\n    ende\n\n    fæst wordhord = ["hwæt", "wyrd"];\n    cweþ wordhord;\n    cweþ cynn(wordhord);\n」）；
